{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28464","headline":"初春雨中舟次和州横江裴使君见迎李赵二秀才同来因书四韵兼寄江南许浑先辈 · 杜牧","name":"初春雨中舟次和州横江裴使君见迎李赵二秀才同来因书四韵兼寄江南许浑先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳草渡头微雨时，万株杨柳拂波垂。\n蒲根水暖雁初浴，梅径香寒蜂未知。\n辞客倚风吟暗淡，使君回马湿旌旗。\n江南仲蔚多情调，怅望春阴几首诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}